          "name": "Pura S\u00e1nchez Zamorano",
          "authorId": "2190142196"
        }
      ],
      "year": 2009,
      "abstract": "(The 19 of January, 2009 I went to see Professor Kolakowski in Oxford with an intention altogether simple, or so I thought. Last year 2008 had marked the 30 anniversary of the first publication in English of what many consider his most influential work \u2013 Main Currents of Marxism \u2014, and I wanted to join in the commemoration. Above all, I wanted to acquaint the Spanish youngest public, a public which only recently is approaching Kolakowski \u0301s thought in any detail, with that work\u2019s (and related ones \u0301) main ideas. Having his author speaking about Main Currents, I gathered, is the best way to go. Yet, life most often finds a way of surprising us and, as the reader will read below, I had to somehow wrestle with Kolakowski himself for him to finally acknowledge the originality of his \u2013 if not magnum, at the least impressive \u2014 opus.)",
